## ⚠️ **Common Errors & Fix**

### ❌ mvn not recognized

```bat
"C:\Program Files\Apache\maven\bin\mvn.cmd" clean compile
```

---

### ❌ Docker not working

* Start Docker Desktop
* Run Jenkins as Admin

---

### ❌ Port/container conflict

```bat
docker rm -f $(docker ps -aq)
```

